{"document":1,"title":"user in #d6233ab6:d850eba6_2: I'm working on a quilt for my sister's birthday an...","updated_at":"2023-05-28T16:09:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I'm glad you're considering the zigzag stitch method. I've heard that it's a good alternative to serging, especially when working with delicate fabrics like velvet and lace. Speaking of which, I've been experimenting with natural dyes lately, and indigo was another natural ingredient I utilized to achieve an interesting shade in my yarn dyeing experiment. I'm thinking of using that yarn to knit a pair of socks. Have you ever worked with naturally dyed yarns or fabrics? Do you think they'd be suitable for a quilt like mine?","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"d6233ab6:d850eba6_2\"}"}
{"document":2,"title":"user in #d6233ab6:94bc18df_3: I'm trying to find some new music to listen to. I'...","updated_at":"2023-05-20T02:42:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I'll definitely take those tips into consideration. Speaking of epic nights, I'm still on a high from the Khalid concert at the Greek Theatre in Berkeley with my sister, Sophia - it was such an amazing experience! Do you think you could recommend some similar artists or songs that might give me that same feeling?","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"d6233ab6:94bc18df_3\"}"}
{"document":3,"title":"user in #d6233ab6:ecfd2047_1: I'm trying to get a better handle on my shopping h...","updated_at":"2023-05-27T15:40:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I'm interested in trying out Mint and YNAB to see which one works better for me. I've also been thinking about using the envelope system to help me stick to my budget. Do you think it's a good idea to use a combination of digital tools and the envelope system to track my spending?","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"d6233ab6:ecfd2047_1\"}"}
