{"document":3,"title":"user in #d6233ab6:ecfd2047_1: I'm trying to get a better handle on my shopping h...","updated_at":"2023-05-27T15:40:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I like the idea of setting a budget and prioritizing needs over wants. However, I'm struggling to allocate a specific amount for luxury purchases. I feel like I need to identify the triggers that cause me to splurge on luxury items. For instance, I've noticed that I tend to splurge when I'm feeling stressed or down. Do you have any tips on how to manage emotional spending?","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"d6233ab6:ecfd2047_1\"}"}
